        "# Bytecode\n",
        "\n",
        "Bytecode is the instruction representation executed by the Python virtual machine. It is an implementation detail and can change between Python releases.\n",
        "\n",
        "Source: [Python glossary](https://docs.python.org/3/glossary.html#term-bytecode)"
      ]
